# 🏉 Rugby Team Management System

## Overview

The Rugby Team Management System is a full-stack web application designed to simplify the management of rugby teams. It provides a secure platform where administrators can manage players, matches, and user accounts, while authenticated users can view team information through a role-based access system.

This project was developed using **React with TypeScript** for the frontend, **ASP.NET Core Web API (C#)** for the backend, and **Microsoft SQL Server** as the database.

---

## Features

### Authentication
- Secure user login
- Role-based authorization (Admin and Viewer)
- Password hashing for secure credential storage
- Optional user registration

### Player Management (Admin)
- Add new players
- Edit player information
- Delete players
- View all players
- Manage player details including:
  - Name
  - Surname
  - Age
  - Nickname
  - Position
  - Tries
  - Conversions
  - Statistics (optional)

### Match Management (Admin)
- Add match details
- Edit existing matches
- Delete matches
- View match history

Match information includes:
- Date
- Opponent
- Score
- Location

### Viewer Features
- View player profiles
- Browse all players
- View match history
- View match results

